Privacy Policy
Egg to Empire: Burger Tycoon · Vainsteel Studios · Last updated: 20 October 2026
Applies to the Android (Google Play) and iOS (Apple App Store) versions.
Short version. This game has no accounts and no sign-up. We do not collect your name, email address or phone number. Your progress is saved on your device. Ads and in-app purchases are handled by third parties (ad networks, Google Play and the Apple App Store), which process limited technical data under their own policies.
1. Who we are
Egg to Empire: Burger Tycoon (bundle / package identifier com.vainsteel.burger) is developed and published by Vainsteel Studios, an independent game studio based in Ankara, Türkiye.

You can reach us at vainsteelstudios@gmail.com.

2. Information stored on your device
The game saves your progress locally on your device using standard app storage. This includes:

game state — coins, gems, buildings, upgrades, recipes, research, branches, achievements;
preferences — language, sound and music settings;
purchase flags — whether you own Remove Ads or the Supporter Pack.
This data stays on your device. We do not upload it, and we cannot read it. Uninstalling the app, or using Settings → Reset Game, deletes it permanently. There is no cloud backup, so a reset or uninstall cannot be undone by us.

3. Advertising
The free version of the game shows ads supplied by third-party advertising networks. To serve and measure those ads, the networks may process:

your device's advertising identifier;
coarse technical information such as device model, operating system version, language and approximate region;
your IP address;
interaction data such as whether an ad was shown, viewed or clicked.
We do not receive, store or sell this data. It is processed by the ad network under its own privacy policy.

On iOS. Before any advertising identifier is used for tracking, iOS asks for your permission through Apple's App Tracking Transparency prompt. If you decline, the game and its ads keep working — the ads are simply not personalised. You can change this choice at any time in Settings → Privacy & Security → Tracking, or limit tracking entirely.

On Android. You can reset or delete your advertising ID in Settings → Google → Ads.

The game never interrupts play with advertising. Every ad is optional and started by you, in exchange for an in-game bonus — you can ignore all of them and still finish the game. Purchasing Remove Ads or the Supporter Pack grants those same bonuses without showing an ad.

4. In-app purchases
Purchases are processed entirely by the platform you installed the game from — Google Play Billing on Android, Apple StoreKit on iOS. We never see or store your payment card, billing address, Google account or Apple ID. The store returns to the game only a confirmation of whether a purchase completed successfully, which the game records locally as a purchase flag.

Restoring purchases works the same way: the game asks the store which non-consumable products you already own and unlocks them again. No personal data reaches us in that exchange.

5. Permissions
The game requires internet access to load ads and to verify purchases. It does not request access to your contacts, camera, microphone, photos, health data, precise location or files, and it contains no analytics SDK of our own.

On iOS the only permission prompt you may see is the App Tracking Transparency request described above; declining it does not restrict any part of the game.

6. Children
This game is not directed at children. It is rated for a general audience but is intended for players aged 13 and over, and it is not part of Google Play's Designed for Families programme or Apple's Kids Category. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.

If you believe a child has provided personal information to a third party through this app, contact us at vainsteelstudios@gmail.com and we will help you raise it with the relevant provider.

7. Data retention and your choices
Because we hold no personal data on our own servers, there is nothing for us to retain, export or erase on your behalf. You remain in full control:

Erase your game data — use Settings → Reset Game, or uninstall the app.
Limit ad personalisation — on iOS, decline the tracking prompt or turn tracking off in Settings → Privacy & Security → Tracking; on Android, reset or delete your advertising ID in Settings → Google → Ads.
Stop ads entirely — purchase Remove Ads or the Supporter Pack.
8. Changes to this policy
If this policy changes, the updated version will be published at this address and the "last updated" date above will change. Significant changes will also be noted in the app's store listing.

9. Your legal rights
Depending on where you live, you may have rights to access, correct, delete or restrict the use of personal data about you, including under the EU/UK GDPR and Türkiye's KVKK. Because this game stores no personal data on our servers and we hold nothing that identifies you, there is normally nothing for us to produce or delete. Data processed for advertising is held by the ad network, so requests about it should go to that provider; contact us and we will point you to the right one.

10. Contact
For any question about this policy or about your data, contact Vainsteel Studios at vainsteelstudios@gmail.com. We aim to reply within 30 days.

